Public-good note

A U.S. provisional patent application for the PIF methodology (#63/845,773,
filed July 2025) expired without conversion. There is no live patent claim
and the work is not offered for sale or acquisition.

The framework and daily reading are unpaid and open. Use them. If you take
the project on, credit to Pauline Gonen-Smith for the PIF/PUF framework is
the requested acknowledgment.
